{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb, fail, curse \u2013 all over again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunny Guys is a merciless obstacle race for bunnies with nerves of steel. Whether solo or in online multiplayer with up to 8 players: only those with focus, precision, and perseverance will make it to the top; everyone else ends up... at the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb dangerous courses, dodge nasty traps, and master tricky jumps. A small mistake can set you back a long way, but scattered checkpoints give you a breather before things get serious again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone, challenge your friends, or compete against others. The fastest finisher secures a place on the global leaderboard and will be rewarded with the Steam achievement &quot;Golden Bunny&quot; and an epic fireworks display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging climbing gameplay with few, fair checkpoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer for up to 8 simultaneous players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboard with time comparison</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints, traps, and plenty of frustrating moments included</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average playtime: 60\u2013120 minutes (depending on the number of falls)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far will you get, and how often will you have to start all over again?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Winner!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2218460/f7662b0d70abe609c7eef0490d0c225d3c152efe.jpg"},{"name":"Hour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2218460/686dc0f55e6b7c6ed5088a832eada1849433b5a3.jpg"},{"name":"Two Hours","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams